### B. `modules.schema` is checked only in `init.lua`, not inside each module
- **Source:** `code-review`
- **File:** lua/rails-tools/init.lua:21-29
- **Spec line:** implement.md Design: "gate the three calls in `init.lua` ... Nothing else calls these three `setup()` functions".
